    'body'        => <<<'HTML'
<p>A Shopify side hustle is one of the few online businesses where you own the customer, the brand and the checkout. That is also why it is harder than it looks: Shopify gives you a store, not shoppers. This guide covers what it costs in 2026, which business models actually leave money on the table after fees, how to launch in a weekend, and the Shopify-adjacent gigs that pay even if you never sell a product yourself.</p>

