<div class="callout"><strong>Quick take:</strong> The Shopify side hustles that work part-time share three traits: no or little inventory risk, a margin of at least $10 per order after every fee, and a traffic source you control (an audience, a local market, search or a marketplace you cross-list on).</div>

<h2 id="what-it-costs">What Shopify costs in 2026</h2>
<p>Shopify's pricing has two parts: a monthly plan and payment processing on every sale. These are the published rates as of 2026 for US stores. Shopify adjusts pricing periodically, so confirm on <a href="https://www.shopify.com/pricing">shopify.com/pricing</a> before you commit.</p>

<table class="data">
  <thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Monthly billing</th><th>Annual billing</th><th>Online card rate</th><th>Third-party gateway fee</th></tr></thead>
